Word - a word processor that reads Microsoft Word files
=======================================================

!Word, in the MoreApps directory on the hard disc, is the start of a
word processor for Microsoft Word documents (.docx files). This first
version is a viewer: it opens a Word document, shows its text with
the formatting it uses, lets you select text, and saves a copy of it
that loses nothing. It cannot edit yet - that, page layout and
printing come in later versions (see section 8).

It is written in JavaScript, and it is all on the disc: you can read
it (and change it) in !JsEdit, like the programs in the Programming
guide.

